  "about": "Passive signatures of Flock Safety hardware and other surveillance / police gear, shared by the desktop (src/flockdetector.cpp, compiled in, overridable by <data dir>/signatures/surveillance.json) and Android (collector/FlockDetectorKotlin.kt, an asset copied from this file at build time). One file, one rule set: both evaluate it the same way (docs/DETECTION.md). Identifiers such as OUIs, UUIDs and SSIDs are facts, re-derived from the cited public registries.",
